    "type": 0,
    "content": "After contacting the creator of the original afk chart and confirming that it won't be updated i was thinking of uploading my afk gain calculator for you guys to use.\n\nIt hasnt been testet too much so if you find any faults or bonuses im missing, don't hesitate to leave a comment so i can change it 😄\n\nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1HzaFa1SPXtdf7EMKSBp4klFBTs19ajE6jNEtfFNoBcA/copy\n\nHow to use:\n-make a copy of the spreadsheet \n-Fill in your bonuses in the white areas\n-Fill in your multipliers from Bubbles/Starsign below\n-uncheck every node, you cant possibly get to yet or won't achieve for a while (yes im looking at you premium hat) so the result will be more fitting to your current progress\n\nTo do: clarification of bonuses for new players",
